{"counts":{"canonical":13,"context":0,"total":13,"unknown_date":0,"unlinked":0},"events":[{"aliases":["Chinchorro","丧葬","遗体处理"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["钦乔罗文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-6abcf6ce3331b30f63ffec6d","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-6abcf6ce3331b30f63ffec6d","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5497db2bba26e3b36f16fc2b","summary":"钦乔罗文化的海洋狩猎采集群体，约在公元前5450至前890年生活于今智利北部干旱的阿塔卡马沿海。海洋资源是其生计的重要基础，遗址中发现用骨、贝壳以及矿物和植物材料制作的工具，也保存了格外复杂的葬俗证据。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5450—前890年","end_year":-890,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5450},"title":"钦乔罗海洋采集群体发展人工木乃伊葬俗"},{"aliases":["Prehistoric Pile Dwellings around the Alps","居住建筑","环境利用"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-843c3d0b25516b22aa225af7","summary":"约公元前5000至前500年，阿尔卑斯及周边人群在湖岸、河边和湿地附近营建桩上聚落。列入世界遗产的系列包含多个国家的一百余处遗址，记录了新石器时代至青铜时代不同群体的居住方式。它们不是一座持续存在的城市，而是一组跨越漫长时期的聚落材料。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000—前500年","end_year":-500,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"阿尔卑斯周边群体营建水边桩上聚落"},{"aliases":["The Neolithic Settlement of Burzahom","居住建筑","生活史"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-a931b99a7f349b23461c292e","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a931b99a7f349b23461c292e","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-7ac51d7f8dec2be8692d30ee","summary":"布尔扎霍姆遗址位于克什米尔地区，约公元前3000至前1000年的序列保存了居住形式的变化。早期居民在天然土中开挖圆形或椭圆形坑室，坑口附近的柱洞，使研究者推测上部曾有遮蔽物。坑内及地面附近的炉址等材料，为理解居住活动提供了线索。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3000—前1000年","end_year":-1000,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-3000},"title":"布尔扎霍姆群体由坑穴住居转向地面泥砖建筑"},{"aliases":["Vedic Age","历史分期","宗教传统"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["吠陀文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-ee7656bf5f7b0fb5c6ea2f61","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-ee7656bf5f7b0fb5c6ea2f61","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-ca9294b7753aa283a4226b07","summary":"吠陀时代是南亚历史中的长期阶段，教材采用约公元前一七〇〇至六〇〇年的范围，以吠陀宗教文本得名。相关叙述把这一阶段放在哈拉帕城市衰落之后，关注讲印度雅利安语言的人群迁入旁遮普，并逐渐向恒河流域扩展、同原有居民互动的过程。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1700年—公元前600年","end_year":-600,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1700},"title":"南亚吠陀时代"},{"aliases":["Poverty Point","土方工程","聚落"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","宗教"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-24e378dd0db2af339a694e5c","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-24e378dd0db2af339a694e5c","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-cc0b3171b3a9c7079fed921d","summary":"庞蒂岬遗址位于今美国路易斯安那州东北部、密西西比河下游的高地。约公元前一七〇〇至一一〇〇年，当地狩猎、捕鱼和采集人群营建并使用土丘、弧形土垄和中央广场，兼作居住与仪式场所，展现了庞大的集体土方劳动。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1700—前1100年","end_year":-1100,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1700},"title":"庞蒂岬群体营建居住与仪式场所"},{"aliases":["Shang Dynasty","文字","早期王朝"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["商"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-b41382293c427605b9ce9c4a","images":[],"map_reference":{"checked_at":"2026-10-25","kind":"region_reference","label":"商朝","latitude":36.12083333,"license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/","longitude":114.325,"note":"本条主体明确记载商代，地图表示该国家或历史政权的关联范围，不表示精确事件发生地点。 地理补录不代表整条史实已经终审。","precision":"country","role":"材料涉及国家或政权","source_title":"Wikidata Q128938 · P625","source_url":"https://www.wikidata.org/w/index.php?title=Q128938&oldid=2523631595"},"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-b41382293c427605b9ce9c4a","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-fa58a75a60edd579a47732a1","summary":"商代是中国早期王朝史的重要阶段，本条采用约公元前一六〇〇至一〇四六年的概括范围。甲骨文字是认识商代的重要材料，尤其来自安阳附近晚期王都的发掘；这些刻辞使研究者能够把考古遗存同王室活动、祖先祭祀与占卜实践联系起来。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1600年—公元前1046年","end_year":-1046,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1600},"title":"商代与甲骨文字材料"},{"aliases":["Vedas","口传","经典"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["古代南亚吠陀文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-56d42ab06d7fea906291cccd","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-56d42ab06d7fea906291cccd","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-9424ac323ccff14a9bcb286a","summary":"吠陀宗教文本的早期形成，主要依靠口头创作与背诵传承。所引教材把这组文本的形成约置于公元前一五〇〇至九〇〇年；其中《梨俱吠陀》收有一千余首献给诸神的赞歌，是研究这一时期语言、宗教和生活的重要材料。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1500年—公元前900年","end_year":-900,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1500},"title":"吠陀文本的口传形成阶段"},{"aliases":["Lapita","航海","迁徙"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["拉皮塔文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-52fbdf753d3de83af6df1c85","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-52fbdf753d3de83af6df1c85","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-c53ebf1793848d378aad6301","summary":"拉皮塔是考古学家依据特色陶器辨识的一种太平洋古代文化，以新喀里多尼亚的一处遗址得名。约公元前一五〇〇年起，相关人群逐渐向东穿行美拉尼西亚岛屿，约在前一〇〇〇年到达汤加和萨摩亚；这一范围描述的是多代人的海上扩展。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1500—前1000年","end_year":-1000,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1500},"title":"拉皮塔人群向汤加与萨摩亚扩展"},{"aliases":["Chavin (Archaeological Site)","祭祀建筑","石构工程"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","艺术"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["查文文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-280b5328278768f1896e83d1","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-280b5328278768f1896e83d1","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-34088c0f4e147299b1e2cc92","summary":"查文遗址坐落在秘鲁安第斯山的高山谷地，并为查文文化命名。这里的台地、广场和石砌建筑构成宗教仪式中心，内部还有廊道、通风设施与排水网络。建筑及石雕中反复出现人形、兽形图像，是理解当地宗教表达的实物线索。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1500—前300年","end_year":-300,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-1500},"title":"查文文化营建石构祭祀建筑"},{"aliases":["Human head with gold mask","金工","青铜","造像"],"body":[],"categories":["艺术","科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-eac0fdd6b3f7317242457094","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-eac0fdd6b3f7317242457094","record_type":"work","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-02c9c51fe9522db197196b96","summary":"这件戴金面罩的青铜人头像出自三星堆二号坑，香港故宫文化博物馆展览采用约公元前一三〇〇至一一〇〇年的定年。头像接近真人大小，耳部比例很大，面形较瘦，眉毛粗厚、眼角锐利，面部覆盖以金箔制成的面罩，形成金与青铜的组合。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1300—前1100年","end_year":-1100,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"year_range","start_year":-1300},"title":"三星堆覆金面罩青铜人头像"},{"aliases":["Yin Xu / 殷墟","早期国家","城市","文字","青铜工艺"],"body":[],"categories":["政治","文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-a067e951dcf760329e0da52d","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a067e951dcf760329e0da52d","record_type":"site","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5b94f721e2a935c23f997f45","summary":"殷墟位于河南安阳洹河两岸，是商代晚期王都遗址。世界遗产介绍采用约公元前一三〇〇至一〇四六年的范围，主要包括宫殿宗庙区和王陵区。夯土基址、木构遗迹、祭祀坑与墓葬，共同呈现了王室居住、祭祖和埋葬活动的空间。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1300—前1046年","end_year":-1046,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-1300},"title":"殷墟晚商都城、宫庙与甲骨文字"},{"aliases":["Shang and Western Zhou grain wines","酿造","饮食","考古化学"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-3edcbd9b1be110b2f0cdc9fb","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-3edcbd9b1be110b2f0cdc9fb","record_type":"work","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-25040860169de179ba84d85b","summary":"安阳及黄河流域贵族墓葬的一些商末周初青铜器中，曾保存液体残留。宾夕法尼亚大学博物馆参与的研究，对约公元前一二五〇至一〇〇〇年器物中的液体进行化学分析，辨认出以稻米或粟类谷物酿造的酒，并发现可能用于调味的草本、花或树脂成分。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1250—前1000年","end_year":-1000,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"year_range","start_year":-1250},"title":"商末周初青铜容器中的米粟酒"},{"aliases":["Merneptah Stele","战争"],"body":[],"categories":["政治"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["埃及第十九王朝"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-74f35069a517ac67efcc2768","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-74f35069a517ac67efcc2768","record_type":"event","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-b8fa3ceba93bae0c7da86eb7","summary":"约公元前1208年，即麦伦普塔统治第五年前后，利布国王联合若干北方群体，从埃及西侧发动进攻。麦伦普塔击退来袭军队，并以王室纪功碑记录这一胜利。石碑正文的大部分内容都同古代利比亚人及其盟友有关，反映了第十九王朝晚期埃及面对外来军事压力的局面。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前1208年","end_year":-1208,"kind":"point","precision":"year","start_year":-1208},"title":"麦伦普塔击退利比亚军队进攻"}],"revision":"16e2d9bc7dac753e8ae63fc6d7d5464fd2e2ef9bb6dc2e0855171d4b9b35d835","schema_version":"1.0.0","scope":"public_database","sources":[],"time_bounds":{"max_year":2026,"min_year":-10000}}